msgid "No API keys issued."
msgstr "Ingen API-nøklar utferda."

#: aot_flask/templates/settings/user_detail.html:161
msgid "Read-only keys can fetch data but cannot change anything."
msgstr "Skriveverna nøklar kan hente data, men kan ikkje endre noko."

#: aot_flask/templates/settings/user_detail.html:169
msgid ""
"Name the client this key is for, so you know what you are cutting off "
"later."
msgstr ""
"Namngje klienten denne nøkkelen er for, slik at du veit kva du koplar frå"
" seinare."

